<title>SRI LANKA: Central Finance Q1 net falls 32 pct.</title>
<headline>Central Finance Q1 net falls 32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the three months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				Q1 96/97	    Q1 95/96</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,239.62   vs     1,029.83</p>
<p>    Net profit		 24.45   vs	  35.85</p>
<p>    Tax provision	     0.87   vs	   3.01</p>
<p>NOTE - Central Finance Co Ltd, Sri Lanka's biggest finance company, consolidates results with Central Industries Ltd, CF Venture Fund Ltd, Central Securities Ltd. It said the profit fall was mainly due to the fall in value of its share investment. -- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
